          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it actually work for beginners?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The stamp is designed specifically for beginners. One press creates the wing shape, and the liner side connects it smoothly — no skills, no practice needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_AE8axB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if my eyes are different shapes or sizes?",
            "text": "<p>The stamp works on all eye shapes. Because you control the angle and pressure, you can slightly adjust the wing to suit your eye while still keeping both sides balanced.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_zAKeDz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the liner waterproof or will it smudge?",
            "text": "<p>The formula is waterproof, smudge-resistant, and long-lasting. It stays clean through heat, sweat, and long days without fading or transferring.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_C7p7Br": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does one eyeliner last?",
            "text": "<p>With normal daily use, one stamp lasts for weeks. Because the application is precise, you don’t waste product like traditional liners.</p>"
          }
        }
